{"id":"4fecf98f-0d7d-4d6e-a75c-bacd7b58cc64","object":"chat.completion","created":1785024812,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    word_token_indices = case['word_token_indices']\\n    word_labels = case['word_labels']\\n    token_count = case['token_count']\\n    \\n    # Validate lengths\\n    if len(word_token_indices) != len(word_labels):\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Mismatch between word_token_indices and word_labels lengths\\\")\\n    \\n    # Initialize token_labels with None (uncovered)\\n    token_labels = [None] * token_count\\n    \\n    # Assign labels and check overlaps / out-of-range\\n    for indices, label in zip(word_token_indices, word_labels):\\n        for idx in indices:\\n            if idx < 0 or idx >= token_count:\\n                raise ValueError(f\\\"Token index {idx} out of range [0, {token_count-1}]\\\")\\n            if token_labels[idx] is not None:\\n                raise ValueError(f\\\"Overlapping token index {idx}\\\")\\n            token_labels[idx] = label\\n    \\n    # Check for uncovered indices\\n    if any(label is None for label in token_labels):\\n        uncovered = [i for i, label in enumerate(token_labels) if label is None]\\n        raise ValueError(f\\\"Uncovered token indices: {uncovered}\\\")\\n    \\n    # Build kept_indices from labels == 1\\n    kept_indices = [i for i, label in enumerate(token_labels) if label == 1]\\n    \\n    return {\\n        'kept_indices': kept_indices,\\n        'token_labels': token_labels\\n    }\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) according to the spec. The task is NLP-LL2-01. The payload has fields: word_token_indices (list of lists of ints), word_labels (list of ints of same length as word_token_indices), token_count (int). We need to project word labels onto token indices. For each word group (list of token indices), assign its word_label to all tokens in that